<mxCell id="c_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Product Costing ERD (UC-N05..UC-N14, FR-37..FR-49) -- from client ERD input/ERD Product Costing-Production Report.jpg + 2026-10-07 decisions + Rev.1 Use Case Product Costing (2026-10-19)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="10" width="2100" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=2;fontSize=9;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="product_lvl_4 and material are drawn here with their Product Costing columns (page 1 shows the reduced Produksi view of the same tables). Header-to-detail FKs on price_reference_header and flow_process_header follow the client ERD as drawn. id_product_lvl_2 on flow_process_header and rate_bahan_pendukung_foh is the Product Category (Level 2) key (FR-42/FR-44); the Level 2 master is not drawn here, so no edge. man_power_rate_component is inferred from FR-43 (not in the client ERD). Rev.1 (2026-10-19): berat_per_meter moved from material to bom_detail (computed, UC-04); master_standard_material added (UC-03, global, no relations, no units shown); costing uses Price Reference Max only (UC-06); rate_generals is one column per rate; pricelist_header/detail and product_catalog_header/detail follow UC-16..UC-19 (structure confirmed by user 2026-10-19). Round 2 (2026-10-19, OQ 12-17): max_price_reference added; man_power_rate gives Rate 1/3 Operator (porsi_operator), rate_borongan_helper per Product Category gives the Helper part; rate_pendukung_khusus and rate_foh are Rp/Kg; rate_negotiation_allowance is per Product Category (moved out of rate_generals); reject_reason on pricelist_header; Product Catalog stored as data. No edges to production_report_items: its cost columns are values frozen at report creation (FR-49 / NFR-09). Rate versioning is not designed yet; latest_update / updated_by only. Round 3 (2026-10-20): faktor_indirect_labor is its own master (global, changeable) referenced by man_power_cost via id_faktor_indirect_labor and removed from man_power_rate; man_power_cost.rate_man_power became rate_1_3_operator (no single Rate Man Power Rp/jam); rate_borongan_helper is Rp/Meter only. Round 4 (2026-10-20): Lebar produk = kolom wide yang sudah ada (D1). Nama tabel/kolom di kode harus sama dengan ERD; tabel yang sudah ada di aplikasi (product_lvl_4, material = new_inventory_4) digambar ringkas sampai SHOW CREATE TABLE (D0) dikonfirmasi - pemetaan nama kolom: .artifacts/master_data_product_costing/pemetaan_nama_kolom_erd_20-10-2026.md. Naming 2026-10-20 (user): tabel baru menunjuk produk lewat code_lv4 dan Product Category lewat code_lv2 (kode level 2 dibuat otomatis P2+yy+6 digit, unik global); entitas product_lvl_4 dan material (= tabel new_inventory_4) memakai nama kolom nyata dari kode (code_lv1..code_lv4, nama, wide, width, thickness); kolom ringkasan lain menunggu SHOW CREATE TABLE (D0). NFR-15: nama kolom program = nama ERD. K6 (2026-10-20): flow_process_detail.id_flow_process_header dan price_reference_detail.id_price_reference_header menggantikan FK arah terbalik; history_purchase dicari per id_material (tanpa FK). Update 2026-10-21 (BPMN Sales D01): entitas rate_negotiation_allowance_request = pengajuan perubahan rate Extra Margin oleh Sales Manager, disetujui GM (FR-67); rate aktif berubah hanya setelah Approved. Usulan 2026-10-21 (FR-68..FR-70): entitas bottom_price_notification = notifikasi perubahan Bottom Price untuk Sales Manager (Ajukan Rate Extra Margin Baru atau Tidak Perlu Diubah); sistem tidak mengubah rate atau Pricelist otomatis (NFR-16). History (2026-10-21, diusulkan): history_costing dan history_pricelist menyimpan riwayat perubahan Bottom Price dan Pricelist (hanya baca; FR-71..FR-73)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="35" width="2700" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
