<mxCell id="c_n_mp" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Man Power Cost (Rp/meter) = (total_man_hour x rate_1_3_operator + rate_borongan_helper Rp/Meter) x faktor_indirect_labor; Rp/Kg = Rp/Meter / Berat/Meter. faktor_indirect_labor adalah master sendiri (nilainya bisa berubah; user 2026-10-20), dipakai man_power_cost lewat id_faktor_indirect_labor. rate_1_3_operator (Rp/jam) = ROUNDUP((rate_direct_labor operator / jam_kerja_per_bulan) x porsi_operator (1/3)). Borongan hanya Rp/Meter (tanpa Rp/Pcs dan tanpa konversi). Helper memakai master Borongan per Product Category (UC-07)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2320" y="1790" width="300" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
